Reading: the token set is matched by EXACT string in the data cell, so a
verdict written `KILLED` or **KILLED** or `killed` is not a verdict to
this reader: the row is refused with `no-verdict`. The HEADER cell, by
contrast, goes through norm_cell() and is matched case-insensitively
and formatting-insensitively. The asymmetry is undeclared in the plan.

