G5 table indented 4 spaces (an indented CODE block in GFM)     tables=1 verdict_tables=1 badrows=1  ['out-of-set:3:X1']
G6 table indented 2 spaces (GFM-legal, <=3 spaces)             tables=1 verdict_tables=1 badrows=1  ['out-of-set:3:X1']
G7 table inside a blockquote (GFM-legal)                       tables=0 verdict_tables=0 badrows=1  ['stray-verdict:3:> | X1 | a | KILLED |']
G8 table without leading/trailing pipes (GFM-legal)            tables=1 verdict_tables=1 badrows=1  ['out-of-set:3:X1']
G9 table broken by a heading (GFM: broken at a block-level structure) tables=1 verdict_tables=1 badrows=1  ['out-of-set:3:X1']
G10 remainder row with MORE cells than the header (GFM: excess ignored) tables=1 verdict_tables=1 badrows=1  ['out-of-set:3:X1']
G11 remainder row with FEWER cells (GFM: empty cells inserted) tables=1 verdict_tables=1 badrows=1  ['width:3:cells=1']
